    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a colorful, retro-inspired adventure, and navigate vibrant, mazes packed with clever challenges, traps, hidden secrets, and quirky characters. <i>Wormstep</i> combines the classic <i>Sokoban</i> puzzle gameplay with <i>Snake</i> - and adds a good couple of fun surprises to it as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936390/extras/ff92491721110a160a5bf43fac2f36ae.poster.avif?t=1734003404\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936390/extras/ff92491721110a160a5bf43fac2f36ae.webm?t=1734003404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibrant, retro style pixel art graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging puzzles, puzzling challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive and dynamic environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both friendly and hostile characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden areas and secret levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customly created levels can be played</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936390/extras/39418b3f494ef2a7e124c66fda6aeb5e.avif?t=1734003404\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLANNED FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple game styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local multiplayer co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Workshop support</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a colorful, retro-inspired adventure, and navigate vibrant, mazes packed with clever challenges, traps, hidden secrets, and quirky characters. <i>Wormstep</i> combines the classic <i>Sokoban</i> puzzle gameplay with <i>Snake</i> - and adds a good couple of fun surprises to it as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936390/extras/ff92491721110a160a5bf43fac2f36ae.poster.avif?t=1734003404\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936390/extras/ff92491721110a160a5bf43fac2f36ae.webm?t=1734003404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibrant, retro style pixel art graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging puzzles, puzzling challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive and dynamic environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both friendly and hostile characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden areas and secret levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customly created levels can be played</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936390/extras/39418b3f494ef2a7e124c66fda6aeb5e.avif?t=1734003404\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLANNED FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple game styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local multiplayer co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Workshop support</p></li></ul>",
